  3 tandems, 3 spokes (2 in the middle)    11    420    38  0.25E   2.82 E on 12  0.00%   0.01%    4 hp   60 ms    3    3
  4 tandems, 3 spokes (2 in the middle)    14    528    37  0.31E   3.72 E on 12  0.04%   0.05%    5 hp   76 ms    3    3
  5 tandems, 3 spokes (2 in the middle)    17    636    37  0.37E   4.31 E on 12  0.11%   0.26%    6 hp   92 ms    4    4
  3 tandems, 18 ch backbone, 3 and 1       10 exchanges -- more than eight trunk groups
  4 tandems, 18 ch backbone, 3 and 1       12 exchanges -- more than eight trunk groups
  5 tandems, 18 ch backbone, 3 and 1       14 exchanges -- more than eight trunk groups
     A chain of tandems is four hops across and spends nothing on depth.  What it cannot do
     is grow: each tandem carries two or three exchanges and there is no room for more.

